- **Session startup**: read `CLAUDE_HANDOFF.md` at repo root before starting any work. It holds the latest infrastructure state, in-flight work, and recent completions. HANDOFF wins when it conflicts with older docs on drift (deployed functions, last commit, pending work). `CLAUDE.md` stays authoritative for stable rules (brand, architecture, role split). Decisions live in `memory/`. Directives live in `docs/directives/`.

